; V, and the values and steps of P and A, of each frame in (interp's first five cards); the frame's ten steps of 20
; samples out, for the excitation: V, P and A for each step, P and A then moving on by their steps.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            frame   INP   v        03-08: a frame
  04                    INP   p
  05                    INP   dp
  06                    INP   a
  07                    INP   da
  08                    CLA   n9
  09                    STO   s
  10            step    OUT   v        10-27: ten steps
  11                    OUT   p
  12                    OUT   a
  13                    CLA   p
  14                    ADD   dp
  15                    STO   p
  16                    CLA   a
  17                    ADD   da
  18                    STO   a
  19                    CLA   s
  20                    SUB   00
  21                    STO   s
  22                    TAC   frame
  23                    JMP   step
  30            v       DATA  0
  31            p       DATA  0
  32            dp      DATA  0
  33            a       DATA  0
  34            da      DATA  0
  35            s       DATA  0
  36            n9      DATA  9
